1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,488
Pilin lingkaran kertas setengah putaran, lalu gunting di tengah.

2
00:00:04,788 --> 00:00:05,971
Dua lingkaran?

3
00:00:05,971 --> 00:00:06,562
Bukan.

4
00:00:07,062 --> 00:00:09,765
Ia terbuka jadi satu lingkaran panjang.

5
00:00:10,265 --> 00:00:11,340
Ikuti satu separuh.

6
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,826
Pilinan menyambungkannya ke separuh lain.

7
00:00:14,126 --> 00:00:17,253
Jadi kedua separuh satu pita, dua kali panjang.

8
00:00:17,753 --> 00:00:21,290
Gunting sepertiga dari tepi: dua lingkaran, saling mengait.

9
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:22,538
Dua?
